Modifications include:
- AniList anime metadata integration, GraphQL querying, and title/season parsing.
- Enhanced playback, pause, and seek synchronization for responsive Discord RPC status.
- Dynamic audio playback presence ("Listening to <Artist> - <Title>").
- Folder privacy filtering (whitelist/blacklist modes).
- Multi-instance player coordination.

